5_2778603811108028476_n.png?_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=Fl9LNiu2t4AQ7kNvwEGfQfi&_nc_oc=AdqFDC-3Z_ooRimLzsgYKxXXVaG-UQyVdBhQvNSx2fM7NrouvXeMsKZapmnbGALLazw&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_Af0pkCWtW9knoLO9-6S4BUtk3IQMclHPo-e0HI91FPb-IQ&oe=69DA4EA1"}, {"file_name": "HighresScreenshot00040.png", "id": "807733037419699", "uri": "https://scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38984472_807733040753032_763200239777074167_n.png?_nc_cat=108&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=RKyS220W9jAQ7kNvwFXTJQR&_nc_oc=AdrbG-jq6QEDvsD-gWMlsr88TKzqoPpep9K88mxfjzuIul5r8XxEKiKlTmXYtzzRY0E&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_Af2htnxXr6GQG8YFfxmZ31nM1D6951cpnsq-RPO-4m5aXA&oe=69DA3978"}, {"file_name": "HighresScreenshot00146.png", "id": "163970600033098", "uri": "https://scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/57566678_163970603366431_5435931785999963108_n.png?_nc_cat=100&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=PJEb1Ml3whgQ7kNvwGGAdPm&_nc_oc=AdooRnC7im30aBfpNPpVxJB6R9nGGYSouwh_3D8f1hd3KbNTg3Qmh9ftymQBNn7Ox0g&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_Af0twUY7BfZVi1TOHbtpI-elyybXnARCHf5V0qlJaQg_Dw&oe=69DA3DF1"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "Trailer_End_Card-Recovered.png", "id": "273391962004750", "uri": "https://scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974788_273391965338083_1886064065722113930_n.png?_nc_cat=106&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=iu4T4qUawlQQ7kNvwGI_dK3&_nc_oc=Adq3zglnABjlkA2VoeIEdmYYvK1bBGc3Zxz7IuTtuK_qiypJvOOZoUaQcVfd3GZie5U&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_Af3mYWIlAjOH_ZlJDVtMpiXnHt7ciJezzmAsGVr1ZGstXA&oe=69DA2E32"}, "display_name": "Ziggy's Cosmic Adventures", "keywords": ["Cockpit", "Alien", "Green", "Space", "Physics"], "long_description": "Ziggy's Cosmic Adventures is a VR cockpit game combining ship management with action-arcade combat. You play as a (sometimes effective) bounty hunter with possibly questionable morals, currently in possession of a powerful little alien that you may or may not have stolen/liberated from the evil Empire. As the Empire closes in, you'll need to find a way to balance your ship's management with the onslaught of attacks. Do you have what it takes to survive?\n\n\u2022 Become one with the ship: Immerse yourself in a cockpit packed full from ceiling to floor with distinct physics-based interactions (Though make sure to keep your eye on them all if you want to survive!).\n\n\u2022 Rebel against The Empire: Engage in thrilling dogfights as squads of enemies pursue you to re-capture the small green treasure aboard your ship - shoot bullets, launch bombs, and raise your shields. It's going to get bumpy!\n\n\u2022 Navigate the vacuum of space: Control the ship with a radical and easy-to-use virtual flight stick design, dodge your way through hazardous space environments, and don't forget to do a barrel roll!\n\n\u2022 The little guy: Who could forget your cosmic friend, Ziggy?! This mysterious creature is a perfect fuel source. You can also play with them, use them as a resource, feed them, and most importantly pet them!\n\n\u2022 The Journey: Fight your way through 13 unique levels total. Forge a different path each time by beating challenges and unlocking harder worlds en route.", "short_description": "Ziggy's Cosmic Adventures is a VR cockpit game combining ship management with action-arcade combat. You play as a (sometimes effective) bounty hunter with possibly questionable morals, currently in possession of a powerful little alien that you may or may not have stolen/liberated from the evil Empire. As the Empire closes in, you'll need to find a way to balance your ship's management with the onslaught of attacks. Do you have what it takes to survive?"}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "Icon.png", "id": "1324311035174797", "image_type": "APP_IMG_ICON", "uri": "https://scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38984472_1324311038508130_2610